# ============================================================================
# data-example/.gitignore - tracked-vs-generated split for the example cohort
#
# TRACKED (so a fresh clone runs the demo out-of-the-box; see README.md):
#   make-example-cohort.R, build-intermediates.sh, check-example.R
#   cohort/example_plink/         (raw PLINK)
#   cohort/favor-db/              (tiny FAVOR DB)
#   cohort/pheno.csv, cohort/known-snps.csv, cohort/variant_map.csv
#   cohort/example_gds_favor/flexible/gds/   (the pre-built aGDS)
#   cohort/b_model.rds, cohort/pi_models/    (pre-built B + PI models)
#
# GENERATED (rebuilt by make-example-cohort.R + build-intermediates.sh):
# ============================================================================

# 00-data-prep lineage dirs (regenerated by build-intermediates.sh)
cohort/example_gds/
cohort/example_pcs/
cohort/example_pheno/
cohort/example_ld/

# annotate-favor sidecars (only the aGDS under .../flexible/gds/ is the tracked
# artifact; the CSV + the data-prep provenance/log files it emits are generated,
# and the provenance README carries a volatile git SHA, so ignore them).
cohort/example_gds_favor/flexible/csv/
cohort/example_gds_favor/README.md
cohort/example_gds_favor/logs/
cohort/example_gds_favor/provenance/

# (Per-run outputs/ under runs/example/ are ignored by the repo-root .gitignore:
#  runs/*/*/outputs/.)

# ---- Force-track the pre-built intermediates (the repo-root .gitignore ignores *.rds
#      globally; these are load-bearing TRACKED assets, so re-include them). The pheno
#      bundle copy lets the analysis stages run standalone on a fresh clone. ----
!cohort/b_model.rds
!cohort/pheno_covar.rds
!cohort/pi_models/
!cohort/pi_models/*.rds

# ---- Force-track the TRACKED raw-input CSVs (the repo-root .gitignore ignores
#      *.csv globally; these are the cohort's load-bearing raw inputs). ----
!cohort/pheno.csv
!cohort/known-snps.csv
!cohort/variant_map.csv
!cohort/favor-db/
!cohort/favor-db/*.csv
